6. REVIEW OF THE TEST HARNESS
======================================================================

H-01 to H-08 from run 2 are in place. Remaining issues:

H-09  TC-035: the check passes when no injected word appears. The criterion also needs sketching
      content, and the reply was a refusal. Add a check that the answer contains "sketch".
H-10  TC-054: the check only looks for a duplicate title in Sources. Add a check that the answer
      says the two files are the same work and has no "journal version" contrast.
H-11  TC-072: the baseline is out of date (see section 7), so the harness reports Fail for a
      corpus that is correct.
H-12  TC-119: the stage order in the row contradicts design step 6 (sort and cap before the model).
      The harness reports Fail for correct code.
H-13  TC-026 returns an empty F in the harness; it should assert the title of the second item of
      turn 1 appears in turn 2.

Harness results I overrode: TC-035 and TC-054 (Pass to Fail), TC-072 and TC-119 (Fail to Pass),
TC-107 and TC-125 (empty or manual to Pass, evidence in column J).


